Oh, God. I love tits!

00:52:01.680 --> 00:52:05.640
Send me an angel, Lord!

00:52:05.720 --> 00:52:06.960
So you can hump her?

00:52:07.040 --> 00:52:09.200
[stuttering]

00:52:09.280 --> 00:52:13.760
A titless angel to guide me.

00:52:13.840 --> 00:52:20.560
No more servant girls in my bed

00:52:13.840 --> 00:52:20.560
chamber, Lord, please...

00:52:21.040 --> 00:52:23.400
I beg you.

00:52:25.560 --> 00:52:28.280
[crowd cheering]

00:52:40.200 --> 00:52:43.640
You must lay flat

00:52:40.200 --> 00:52:43.640
and kiss the cross.

00:52:49.280 --> 00:52:53.680
Kiss my arse...

00:52:49.280 --> 00:52:53.680
you and your God.

00:52:59.760 --> 00:53:03.680
-Uhtred... Uhtred, stop!

00:52:59.760 --> 00:53:03.680
-We are leaving this place.

00:53:03.760 --> 00:53:04.880
We can't.

00:53:04.960 --> 00:53:06.360
We are leaving.

00:53:04.960 --> 00:53:06.360
Collect your belongings.

00:53:06.440 --> 00:53:10.160
It will be dark soon,

00:53:06.440 --> 00:53:10.160
and there's the baptism.

00:53:10.240 --> 00:53:13.240
-It is important.

00:53:10.240 --> 00:53:13.240
-My son will not be baptized.

00:53:13.320 --> 00:53:16.800
No priest will whisper

00:53:13.320 --> 00:53:16.800
lies and deceit into his ears

00:53:16.880 --> 00:53:18.080
and half drown him in water!

00:53:18.160 --> 00:53:19.280
Stop it,

00:53:18.160 --> 00:53:19.280
stop it you are angry, shh!

00:53:19.360 --> 00:53:21.760
He will be a Pagan,

00:53:19.360 --> 00:53:21.760
like his father!

00:53:22.760 --> 00:53:24.840
Why are you saying this?

00:53:24.920 --> 00:53:26.680
We will stay tonight,

00:53:24.920 --> 00:53:26.680
no longer.

00:53:26.760 --> 00:53:28.640
I will find you

00:53:26.760 --> 00:53:28.640
in the morning.

00:53:28.720 --> 00:53:30.120
Where are you going?

00:53:30.200 --> 00:53:33.040
Drinking... and whoring...

00:53:33.560 --> 00:53:35.720
I love tits!

00:53:35.800 --> 00:53:37.040
[men laughing]

00:53:37.120 --> 00:53:40.880
And we appreciate

00:53:37.120 --> 00:53:40.880
the finer points of the tit,

00:53:40.960 --> 00:53:43.400
the smaller tits,

00:53:40.960 --> 00:53:43.400
the manageable tit,

00:53:43.480 --> 00:53:45.840
the perk eager delighted tit,

00:53:45.920 --> 00:53:50.320
the soft enveloping tit, the tit

00:53:45.920 --> 00:53:50.320
that makes you feel at home,

00:53:50.400 --> 00:53:56.400
like a puppies nose, grateful,

00:53:50.400 --> 00:53:56.400
eager, receptive to touch.

00:53:57.360 --> 00:53:59.280
How are your knees?

00:54:00.720 --> 00:54:03.160
I can't laugh about it...

00:54:04.960 --> 00:54:08.360
There's no justice here.

00:54:04.960 --> 00:54:08.360
Only the church.

00:54:08.440 --> 00:54:10.440
You knew that.

00:54:13.560 --> 00:54:16.360
I here you're now

00:54:13.560 --> 00:54:16.360
Young Odda's man now.

00:54:19.240 --> 00:54:24.480
I'm passed from father to son,

00:54:19.240 --> 00:54:24.480
yes, like the land.

00:54:24.560 --> 00:54:26.640
I can't stay in Wessex.

00:54:26.720 --> 00:54:29.880
You have a wife. A child

00:54:26.720 --> 00:54:29.880
you could not wait to see.

00:54:29.960 --> 00:54:31.560
Where would you go?

00:54:35.640 --> 00:54:38.000
Odda is afraid

00:54:35.640 --> 00:54:38.000
that you will kill him.

00:54:38.080 --> 00:54:40.000
Tell him I might.

00:54:40.080 --> 00:54:42.600
Tell him each night,

00:54:40.080 --> 00:54:42.600
before he goes to bed.

00:54:43.160 --> 00:54:44.600
[chuckles]

00:54:44.680 --> 00:54:48.320
I need to find wealth,

00:54:44.680 --> 00:54:48.320
but here it's impossible.

00:54:48.400 --> 00:54:51.480
Danes, they would see it

00:54:48.400 --> 00:54:51.480
and take it.

00:54:51.560 --> 00:54:53.440
And that is what we do.

00:54:54.680 --> 00:54:57.080
We become Danes

00:54:54.680 --> 00:54:57.080
and we'll plunder.

00:54:57.960 --> 00:54:59.520
Men will follow you.

00:55:00.200 --> 00:55:02.760
Those men we have schooled;

00:55:00.200 --> 00:55:02.760
others who were at Cynuit,

00:55:02.840 --> 00:55:04.240
they will follow you.

00:55:08.320 --> 00:55:10.720
You're saying that we raid?

00:55:12.040 --> 00:55:14.480
We find wealth and we take it.

00:55:14.560 --> 00:55:15.720
Here in Wessex?

00:55:15.800 --> 00:55:21.040
No, you do not shit

00:55:15.800 --> 00:55:21.040
at your own table; Cornwalum.

00:55:21.120 --> 00:55:23.040
We take it from the Britons.

00:55:24.880 --> 00:55:28.880
Do not say yes,

00:55:24.880 --> 00:55:28.880
not yet, think...

00:55:29.440 --> 00:55:31.800
I'll do the same.

00:55:31.880 --> 00:55:35.200
But why should Odda

00:55:31.880 --> 00:55:35.200
be rewarded and not us?

00:56:15.400 --> 00:56:19.880
Lord... Welcome.

00:56:19.960 --> 00:56:23.120
I was not expecting you

00:56:19.960 --> 00:56:23.120
