00:56:23.200 --> 00:56:25.000
Did the baptism go well?

00:56:25.720 --> 00:56:27.600
It's a fine tree.

00:56:30.240 --> 00:56:32.480
-Good day, lady.

00:56:30.240 --> 00:56:32.480
-A miserable day.

00:56:32.560 --> 00:56:34.800
[Uhtred]

00:56:32.560 --> 00:56:34.800
Where was it felled, this tree?

00:56:34.880 --> 00:56:36.160
On the top ridge, Lord.

00:56:36.360 --> 00:56:37.880
On my land?

00:56:37.960 --> 00:56:41.080
Yes, Lord. I am taking it

00:56:37.960 --> 00:56:41.080
to Wigulf's Mill, for splitting.

00:56:41.160 --> 00:56:42.160
He buys it?

00:56:42.240 --> 00:56:45.320
He splits it, Lord.

00:56:42.240 --> 00:56:45.320
We need...

00:56:45.400 --> 00:56:47.520
We need timber for repairs.

00:56:47.600 --> 00:56:49.720
He takes his payments

00:56:47.600 --> 00:56:49.720
in split wood.

00:56:49.800 --> 00:56:52.280
If we need timber,

00:56:49.800 --> 00:56:52.280
why not split it ourselves?

00:56:52.360 --> 00:56:54.360
Wigulf has always done it, Lord.

00:56:54.440 --> 00:56:56.280
So if I go to Wigulf,

00:56:56.360 --> 00:56:59.480
he will tell me how many such

00:56:56.360 --> 00:56:59.480
trees he has split.

00:56:59.560 --> 00:57:01.840
And you will show me the timber.

00:57:03.080 --> 00:57:04.760
How much is a tree

00:57:03.080 --> 00:57:04.760
like this worth?

00:57:04.840 --> 00:57:06.680
Eight, nine shillings?

00:57:07.360 --> 00:57:09.040
I'm not certain, Lord.

00:57:09.120 --> 00:57:11.760
How much does he

00:57:09.120 --> 00:57:11.760
pay you for my timber?

00:57:11.840 --> 00:57:13.320
Lord, it is one tree.

00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:14.480
How much does he pay you?

00:57:14.560 --> 00:57:17.000
Lady, please.

00:57:17.080 --> 00:57:20.520
How much does he

00:57:17.080 --> 00:57:20.520
pay you for my timber?

00:57:20.600 --> 00:57:23.840
-Uhtred, no!

00:57:20.600 --> 00:57:23.840
-You be quiet!

00:57:27.800 --> 00:57:28.720
Uhtred!

00:57:28.800 --> 00:57:31.200
[grunting]

00:57:34.960 --> 00:57:37.080
-[horse whinnies]

00:57:34.960 --> 00:57:37.080
-Uhtred!

00:57:37.160 --> 00:57:39.160
[screams]

00:57:44.680 --> 00:57:46.560
[groans in pain]

00:57:50.200 --> 00:57:52.400
[gasps for air]

00:57:57.160 --> 00:57:59.440
[panting]

00:58:01.800 --> 00:58:04.920
That... was justice!